  "description": "A serial killer with a mission. \n\nAria has been a victim of domestic violence since childhood. Eventually, she sees only one way out: murder. After she kills her father, she sets out to save other victims, and crosses paths with a detective who decides to help her. But can she really justify murder in the name of justice? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
